  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Add reflection-based model setters:\n      - Expose Type-based model registration and implement reflection helpers to auto-resolve constructor dependencies.\n      - Added two wrapper methods in Lucifer.cs: SetModelI(Type, Type) and SetModelT(Type, Type).\n      - In LuciferModel.cs added System.Reflection and LINQ.Expressions usages, cached MethodInfo values for existing generic Get/Set methods, and implemented SetModelI and SetModelT to: create an instance of the implementation type (resolving constructor parameters by invoking the generic GetModelI/GetModelT), or create and register a typed Func<T> factory via an expression tree.\n      - Constructors are chosen by highest parameter count. This enables registering implementations by Type with deferred instantiation and automatic dependency resolution.",
